{
  "uid": "vla-mes",
  "id": null,
  "version": 2,
  "title": "VLA MES — engineering view (NOT source of truth)",
  "description": "Internal engineering view. Recomputes MES figures from the batch-engine REST to establish what the data supports; input for batch-engine/vla/kpi.py in phase 4. NOT the source of truth: no screen and no report reads from here. KPIs are owned by GET /api/v1/kpi/summary and report/period.",
