      "id": 999,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## ⚠️ Engineering view — **not the source of truth**\n\nThese figures are recomputed here from the batch-engine REST purely to explore what the data supports. **No screen and no report may read from this dashboard.** A KPI has exactly one place where it is calculated: `GET /api/v1/kpi/summary` and `report/period`, fed by `batch-engine/vla/kpi.py` (phase 4). Two sources computing OEE inevitably produce two different numbers.\n\nFor the live line and ad-hoc time-series exploration, use [VLA Line — Live](/d/vla-line)."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Batches in period",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "marcusolsson-json-datasource",
        "uid": "vla-batch-engine"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "marcusolsson-json-datasource",
            "uid": "vla-batch-engine"
          },
          "method": "GET",
          "urlPath": "/report/period",
          "queryParams": "days=$days",
          "cacheDurationSeconds": 0,
          "fields": [
            {
              "jsonPath": "$.batches_total",
              "name": "batches",
              "type": "number"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "purple",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
